<title>SPAIN: Spanish bonds brighten ahead of FOMC, Bundesbank.</title>
<headline>Spanish bonds brighten ahead of FOMC, Bundesbank.</headline>
<text>
<p>1600 GMT - Government bonds close higher, brightening with other bond markets ahead of U.S. FOMC, Bundesbank decisions on Tuesday where no signals of monetary policy change expected</p>
<p>* 10-yr 7.35 pct T-bond 107.38 vs 107.18, yield 6.29 vs 6.35</p>
<p>* Sept bond future 117.03 vs 116.80 at Thursday's close</p>
<p>* Peseta/mark 84.53/55 vs 84.51/53</p>
